Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,《007系列之幽灵党》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:58.03,Note,,0,0,0,,死而
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.03,0:01:00.66,Note,,0,0,0,,死而复生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:16.09,Note,,0,0,0,,(墨西哥城)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:21.06,Note,,0,0,0,,(亡灵节)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:54.25,Note,,0,0,0,,我说你是不是快等不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.22,0:16:42.68,Note,,0,0,0,,(墨西哥惨剧)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.10,0:22:21.92,Note,,0,0,0,,(临时监护令)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.55,0:28:25.80,Note,,0,0,0,,(谢谢你 詹姆斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.49,0:29:20.55,Note,,0,0,0,,(罗马)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.86,0:37:04.03,Note,,0,0,0,,祝你好运 亲爱的露西亚
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.60,0:37:54.64,Note,,0,0,0,,嘿 要上哪儿去啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.92,0:38:04.60,Note,,0,0,0,,请进吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.73,0:39:02.11,Note,,0,0,0,,沃格尔博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Vogel
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.03,0:46:27.72,Note,,0,0,0,,脑子有病啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.10,0:52:14.11,Note,,0,0,0,,(我们能否确定邦德就在伦敦？)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.40,1:03:40.64,Note,,0,0,0,,在周一进行了测试之后
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.28,1:03:44.28,Note,,0,0,0,,诊断出这位患者患有创伤后应激障碍
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.68,1:03:48.88,Note,,0,0,0,,开了药 进行大强度的认知行为治疗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.47,1:03:51.34,Note,,0,0,0,,以颅骶疗法来辅助
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.04,1:17:00.51,Note,,0,0,0,,(摩洛哥 吉尔丹)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.09,1:24:39.59,Note,,0,0,0,,(与维丝帕·林德对谈)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,007？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}007?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,C\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.19,0:24:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, 007
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,去去就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎 亲爱的斯奇亚拉先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, Signor Sciarra.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,旅途还愉快吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust you had a pleasant journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,带来了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,带来了 在那儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. It's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候炸体育馆？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When do we blow the stadium?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,下午六点钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This evening at six.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那么离开所乘的飞机呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the flight out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,全都安排好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,之后有什么安排？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,之后啊 我就去拜访 幽冥国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I visit The Pale King.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,来干一杯 我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A toast, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,敬亡灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那我先干为敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在广场碰头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet me in the square!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,想从哪儿就从哪说起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start anywhere you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.75,0:16:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你慢慢说 007 不过五分钟后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your time, 007, but in five minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,联合安全局的头儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the head of the Joint Security Service
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,会从那扇门走进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is going to walk through that door,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,而我得向他解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I've got to explain to him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我们的特工会一时兴起 独自去墨西哥晃悠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how one of our agents decided to potter off to Mexico, all on his own,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,然后引发这场国际性事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and cause an international incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:16:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但无论怎么说 没有我们情况会更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all due respect, sir, it could've been worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够糟？你把半条街炸飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worse? You blew up half a bloody block.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,半条街总比牺牲一体育馆的人强吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, better half a block than a whole stadium full of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.10,0:17:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那时你可没拍板的权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had no authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道 我们正经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know, we're in the middle of the biggest shakeup
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,英国情报系统最大规模的改组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the history of British intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.53,0:17:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟军情五处合并的文件还墨迹未干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ink's barely dry on this merger with Ml5...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,五处就盼着找个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and already they're itching for a chance to scrap
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,永远拿掉00项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the double-0 program forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,而你刚好成全了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you've just given them one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.99,0:17:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,今天你的日子不会好过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have got a tricky day ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.25,0:17:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在是在严肃的问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an official question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.63,0:17:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那天在墨西哥城 你到底干什么去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mexico City. What were you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.63,0:17:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是碰巧在度假 早该休的假正好想休了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just a coincidence. I was taking some overdue holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那好 行吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,从今天早上开始你被正式限制行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As of this morning, you are officially grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我决定无限期中止你所有的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm standing you down from all operations indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:17:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很好啊 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,您请讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管你在玩什么小把戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you're playing at,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,最好马上收手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but whatever it is, it has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真对不住 打扰你们了吧？- 哪有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So sorry. Am I interrupting? - Not remotely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,007 这位是麦克斯·登比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}007, I'd like you to meet Max Denbigh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,联合安全局的一把手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}head of the Joint Security Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,终于见到007真身了 听说了不少事迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a pleasure to finally meet you, 007. I've heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of it good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,祝贺你新官走马上任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations on your new appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,现在能叫你C先生了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose we should call you C now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不 叫我麦克斯就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. "Max," please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是叫你C好了 C\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think I'll call you C,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,随你便了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的门永远敞开 007 随时欢迎我的下属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my door is always open, 007, for my employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这次合并掀开了新篇章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This merger's gonna be a whole new chapter for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要带领英国情报系统走出黑暗时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to bring British intelligence out of the Dark Ages
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,重见天日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来相当不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That all sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样 007 明天向Q报到体检 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll be all, 007. Report to Q tomorrow for medical, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.60,0:19:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.89,0:19:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,莫尼彭尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moneypenny...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 会开得怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So? How was the meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.77,0:19:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,法医终于把这个解禁了 这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forensics finally released this. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.11,0:19:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是从天幕庄园抢救出的私人物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's personal effects they recovered from Skyfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 待会儿再给我捎来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect. You can bring it to me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思？- 9点钟送到我家来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean? - My place, 9:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.92,0:19:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你才搬进来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you just moved in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.43,0:19:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你这套布置我挺喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I like what you've clone with the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你的档案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要喝一杯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.19,0:19:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,算了我有不过夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks. I'm not staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那可惜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 詹姆斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on, James?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.57,0:20:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,现在军情六处没有人不在讨论这事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not one person at Ml6 who isn't talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在讨论什么事啊 你说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talking about what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说你在墨西哥这次做的过火了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That what you did in Mexico was one step too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还说你玩完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.25,0:20:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么看？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我恰恰觉得你好戏才开场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you'rejust getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白你的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你手头有个秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you've got a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你跟谁都不想说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's something you won't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你谁都不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you don't trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.66,0:20:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我若有什么不测 007 我需要你做件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anything happens to me, 007, I need you to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,找一个男的 他叫叫马科·斯奇亚拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find a man called Marco Sciarra.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,然后别错过他的葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't miss the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我的老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.05,0:21:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪儿弄到的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,她刚死就发到了我的邮箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my mailbox just after she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,她总能出乎人意料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she was never short of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.31,0:21:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是死亡也阻挡不了她的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wasn't gonna let death get in the way of herjob.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,而我也开始跟踪斯奇亚拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been tracking Sciarra ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.02,0:21:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那你查到什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what have you found?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有什么重大发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing significant yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.23,0:21:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他葬礼是哪天？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When's the funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.19,0:21:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,三天之后 在罗马举行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days. In Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是指望M会批准你去 那你真是疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think M's signing off on that, you're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.91,0:21:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会让你离开半步的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't let you out of his sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 这也算是个小麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it's a bit of a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.41,0:21:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能暗地里帮我挖挖情报去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you do a little quiet digging for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.75,0:21:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我在墨西哥听到一个名字 冥王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard a name in Mexico. "The Pale King."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我给你当卧底吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to be your mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.43,0:21:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你凭什么认为我值得信任？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what makes you think you can trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,直觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.12,0:23:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的老楼 已经计划被拆除了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor old girl. Rigged for demolition in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.71,0:23:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,拆了比修复重建\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheaper to knock her down than to rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.96,0:23:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,要省钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.38,0:23:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,光阴脚步匆匆 谁都不等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time waits for no man and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.72,0:23:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 钱都花到这上面来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, all the money's been spent on this,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.55,0:23:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,国家安全中心的新大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the New Centre for National Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.06,0:23:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这不就是C的新巢穴嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's C's new digs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.40,0:23:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你见过他了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've met him, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天见过 这人什么来头？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yesterday. What do we know about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,典型的中央政府高级官僚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Classic Whitehall mandarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,去年写了份材料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrote a dossier last year
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.65,0:23:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,说00项目已经过时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on how the double-0 program was obsolete,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.74,0:23:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,说无人机可以代劳海外那些龌龊活儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how drones could do all our dirty work abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.07,0:23:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟内政大臣还是同学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Went to school with the Home Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.66,0:23:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,果不其然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这次合并只是开了个头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This merger's just the start of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,三天后在东京有个会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In three days, there's a security conference in Tokyo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,将决定新的世界秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to decide the New World Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.33,0:23:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,若能说动各方 他就有权无限制地获取\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If C gets his way, he'll have unlimited access
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.63,0:23:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,9个国家的情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the combined intelligence streams of nine countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.42,0:23:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,当然也包括我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.72,0:23:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.18,0:24:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你不在的时候发生了许多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, a lot's happened while you were away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.60,0:24:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,汉堡发生列车爆炸 突尼斯发生工厂爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A train bombing in Hamburg and an industrial explosion in Tunisia.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.86,0:24:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这时机对我们不利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not great timing for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.61,0:24:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,全是在帮C的忙啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all rather playing into C's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.20,0:24:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,而M 我猜他也感受到压力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M, well, let's say he's feeling the pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.58,0:24:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I've noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.95,0:24:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这边来 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this way, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.83,0:24:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,留神啊 脚底有点滑滑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful. It's a trifle slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.21,0:24:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,合并之后 Q在高官们面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Q wasn't exactly feeling at home in Whitehall,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.59,0:24:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得不太自在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what with the new merger,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.67,0:24:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,所以在这儿另行开张 躲开那些烦人的眼线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he set up shop here, away from prying eyes, as it were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,听说他为你设计了特别的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear he's got something rather special planned for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.80,0:24:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我都迫不及待了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hardly wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.82,0:24:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 Q - 抱歉 我这里太乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Q. - Please excuse the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.28,0:24:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都还在变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's a little bit up in the air,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.57,0:24:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,还没尘埃落定呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what with the changes and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.91,0:24:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有几样东西要给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple of things to get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.20,0:24:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们先干正事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.54,0:25:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,放松就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.71,0:25:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.00,0:25:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你会觉得有些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you may feel a small...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.92,0:25:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.38,0:25:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,刺痛感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.59,0:25:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.76,0:25:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,最前沿的纳米技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cutting-edge nanotechnology.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.76,0:25:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,智能血液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smart Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.39,0:25:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是血管里的微型芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Microchips in your bloodstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.43,0:25:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可以帮我们定位你在外的活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allows us to track your movements in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.23,0:25:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,看到这些读数了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see those readouts?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.94,0:25:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,在地球任何角落都能测到你的生命体征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can monitor your vital signs from anywhere on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.69,0:25:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这个实在太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that sounds marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.23,0:25:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,算是墨西哥事件后的保险措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call it a post-Mexico insurance policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.11,0:25:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,M直接指示要搞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By direct order of M.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.53,0:25:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这我完全能理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I completely understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.12,0:25:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我这里还有 还有最后一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Well, l'vejust, um, got one last thing for you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.33,0:25:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你看完就能走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you can be on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.80,0:25:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不是一般的气派吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnificent, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.14,0:26:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,起步加速到60迈只需3.2秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero to 60 in three point two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.47,0:26:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,全车身防弹 还深藏各种绝技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fully bulletproof. A few little tricks up her sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.85,0:26:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只可惜她本来是你的 但现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame, really. She was meant for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.69,0:26:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,她配给009使用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she's been reassigned to 009.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.90,0:26:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这个你可以有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.32,0:26:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,能派上大用场吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.99,0:26:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,会报时是肯定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It tells the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,能帮你变得更加守时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might help with your punctuality issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- M的主意吧？- 你猜对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- M's idea? - Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.33,0:26:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,要提醒你一句 这表的闹铃动静相当大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, one word of warning. The alarm is rather loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.17,0:26:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该懂我的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.84,0:26:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.39,0:26:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 这个老家伙得花不少时间呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. That old thing is taking quite a bit of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.89,0:26:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,它大部分已经没法用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind you, there wasn't much left to work on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.44,0:26:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就方向盘还好使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a steering wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.40,0:26:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得告诉过你要带回一整台车 不是带回一台车架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe I said, "Bring it back in one piece," not, "Bring back one piece."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.61,0:27:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧 好好享受假期吧 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, enjoy your downtime, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.95,0:27:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Q - 怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Q. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.45,0:27:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你现在能对我的所有行踪都了如指掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now you know exactly where I am all of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.42,0:27:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那能不能帮我个忙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you do something for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.29,0:27:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你脑子里在想什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you have in mind, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.67,0:27:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,能帮我消失吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make me disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.30,0:27:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,唔 我提醒你一下 我现在直接对M负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I remind you that I answer directly to M.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.97,0:27:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一套按揭要还 还养了两只猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also have a mortgage. And two cats to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.89,0:27:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 所以我建议你最好先相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then I suggest you trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.15,0:27:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕是为了那两只猫呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the sake of the cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.65,0:27:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 007 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's lovely to see you, 007. Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.78,0:27:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我要提醒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, now, I meant to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.07,0:27:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,目前这个智能血液 它显然还处于开发阶段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Smart Blood program is obviously still in its developmental phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.99,0:27:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们也会偶尔遇到 头24小时接收不到信号的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we may experience the odd drop in coverage during the first 24 hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.25,0:27:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,其实48小时内 即便部署了也会有失灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}48 hours after administration,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.59,0:27:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之后就没问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but after that it should work perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.88,0:28:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你寄明信片的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll send you a postcard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.01,0:28:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,求你别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.58,0:28:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.75,0:28:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一个追求者送的礼物而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that? Oh, it'sjust something from an admirer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.79,0:28:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,今天不是你生日吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not your birthday, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.00,0:28:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.76,0:28:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,人家上周才过生日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.97,0:28:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,早啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.05,0:28:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,009已经到了 要来提那辆DB10跑车 他在楼上等你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}009 has arrived to pick up the DB10, sir. He's waiting upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.97,0:28:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 行 先这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good. Yes, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.86,0:29:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这下子好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.41,0:31:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还请夫人节哀顺变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.12,0:31:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识我丈夫吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew my husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.50,0:31:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只简单打过照面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All too briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.83,0:31:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是做什么的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.50,0:31:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,人寿保险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.79,0:31:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜你来的有点晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.63,0:31:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对于您丈夫是晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your husband, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.17,0:31:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不过对您来说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.76,0:31:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,对我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.05,0:31:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说一些寡妇在失去丈夫之后不久就会意外丧命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear the life expectancy of some widows can be very short.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.39,0:31:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么可以这么说你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you talk like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.23,0:31:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没看见我还在悲伤中吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you see I'm grieving?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.81,0:31:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.12,0:34:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,多美妙的景致啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a lovely view.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.17,0:34:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是在浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.42,0:34:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一百多人会追杀我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are 100 more that will come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.05,0:34:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你这只是帮我 活五分钟而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you buy me is five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.88,0:34:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,真是难得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.72,0:34:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,该来喝一杯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time fora drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.40,0:34:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是你杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed him,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.65,0:34:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没说错吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.15,0:34:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了我丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.82,0:34:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他本身就是杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.82,0:34:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 他不会觉得我是私事公办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, he won't take it personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.08,0:34:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是亲手送我上断头台 我以前地位很高的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You signed my death warrant. I was respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.00,0:34:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你在忠于一个你恨的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loyal to a man you hated.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.50,0:34:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他欣赏我的沉默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He trusted my silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.29,0:34:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他走了 我也玩完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With him gone, I'm a dead woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.63,0:34:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我谁都不会相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can trust nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.84,0:34:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我很了解这种感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.92,0:34:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就告诉你 我不信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I can tell you that I don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.55,0:34:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你的直觉相当的准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then you have impeccable instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.76,0:35:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是不马上离开 我们就没命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't leave now, we'll die together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.93,0:35:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这可比别的死法痛快多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can think of worse ways to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.68,0:35:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你简直是是疯了 你叫什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you're obviously crazy, Mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.36,0:35:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.61,0:35:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.62,0:35:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的那些人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.75,0:35:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你可不知道他们的做派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you just knew what they could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.55,0:35:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们能耐非常大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.01,0:35:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你丈夫有没有提及过 冥王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did your husband ever mention "The Pale King?"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.30,0:35:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.22,0:35:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那个神秘的组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The organization,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.68,0:35:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,成员几乎很少见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they hardly ever meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.06,0:35:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但由于我丈夫出了那么大的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Butbecause of what happened to my husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.82,0:35:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们今晚要开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they meet tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.28,0:35:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.07,0:36:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,要挑选出替补的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To choose a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.91,0:36:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.58,0:36:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,在卡登撒华彩宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Palazzo Cardenza.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.24,0:36:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,午夜时分 估计很有看头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Midnight. Sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.00,0:36:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我没准会去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might drop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.12,0:36:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他整个人都陷进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.42,0:36:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他耗在那里的时间比陪我的都要多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He spent more time with them than with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.59,0:36:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那这个男的可真不聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the man was a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.27,0:36:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不留个电话号码？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaving your number?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.86,0:36:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我找了一个美国朋友 叫费利克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've called an American friend of mine. Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.19,0:36:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他会联系美国大使馆带你离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll contact his embassy and get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.74,0:36:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,保证你的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.21,0:36:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 别走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.79,0:36:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能去那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you go there,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.54,0:36:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是个杀人不眨眼的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're crossing over to a place where there is no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.75,0:37:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须得走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.39,0:37:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,还不亮明身份 你这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.31,0:37:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.52,0:38:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我是米老鼠呀 你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.54,0:38:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在线购药网站提供了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pharmacy sites has provided...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.09,0:38:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,很好的新销售平台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an excellent new sales platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.55,0:38:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将许多网站改造成未批准药物的交易场所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have adapted many of them into clearinghouses for unapproved drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.26,0:38:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,除此之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In addition to which,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.89,0:38:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,最新的数据显示 我们已控制了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the latest figures show that we presently control
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.56,0:38:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,70%的抗疟疾疫苗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}70% of antimalarial vaccines,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.69,0:38:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,34%的艾滋病药物和40%肿瘤药物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}34% of H.I.V., and 40% of all oncological drugs
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.36,0:38:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,在撒哈拉以南的市场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}across Sub-Saharan Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.36,0:38:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 世界卫生组织真是跟我们过不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we face challenges from the WHO
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.99,0:38:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正在打击我们所谓的仿冒药品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in their campaign against our counterfeit pharmaceuticals.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.20,0:38:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经锁定需要处理的关键人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have now identified the key individuals to target.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.25,0:39:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,希望能像人口贩卖委员会那次一样成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We expect the same success as we had against the Council on Human Trafficking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.71,0:39:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在委员会全体请辞后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since the board's resignation...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.05,0:39:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已将16万女移民安排进休闲性产业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we have placed 160,000 migrated females into the leisure sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.39,0:39:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而接近完成的 九只眼 全球监控倡议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The impending completion of the Global Surveillance initiative...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.93,0:39:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,意味着我们将拥有独一无二的监视能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will mean our capability is second to none...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.52,0:39:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在到了该强势扩张的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and now is the moment for aggressive expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.52,0:39:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这绝对是个好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The news is only good...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.18,0:40:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,别让我打断你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let me interrupt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.07,0:40:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这绝对是个好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The news is only good...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.91,0:40:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得到增强的监控能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our increased surveillance capability...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.95,0:40:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,意味着来自政府情报机构的阻力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...means government intelligence agencies...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.75,0:40:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,将被轻而易举化解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...are easily counteracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.83,0:40:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们赢定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.00,0:40:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.80,0:40:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,现在来处理手头上的事项\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, on to the matter at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.63,0:40:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们成功实施汉堡和突尼斯的袭击之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the success of our attacks in Hamburg and Tunisia,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.47,0:40:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,在墨西哥城的袭击被迫中止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the aborted attack in Mexico City
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.97,0:40:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们杰出的的同事马科·斯奇亚拉不幸身亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the death of our valued colleague, Marco Sciarra,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.98,0:40:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他身后留下了一项未完成的使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leaves one of his duties outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.44,0:40:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,格拉先生 冥王 必须被处理掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Signor Guerra, The Pale King must be terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.23,0:40:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你可否去趟奥尔陶斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you make the journey to Altaussee?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.78,0:40:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.03,0:40:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我是绝对忠于组织的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My loyalty to this organization is total.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.87,0:41:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我这份忠诚至死不渝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will protect it with my last breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.21,0:41:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不会再有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be no more...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.88,0:41:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,业余之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.54,0:41:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不会再示弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more shows of weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.67,0:41:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在座有没有哪位反对格拉先生接任这个席位？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does anyone challenge Signor Guerra for this position?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.07,0:42:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.24,0:42:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,请陈述你能接任斯奇亚拉的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}State your credentials for succeeding Signor Sciarra.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.00,0:43:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}BLOFELDI It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.30,0:43:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,墨西哥那次宛如钟声勾起了我遥远的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that excitement in Mexico City rang a distant bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.05,0:43:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.97,0:43:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就在今晚一刹那间 我突然就全明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}suddenly, this evening, it makes perfect sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.69,0:43:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎你 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.16,0:43:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真是好久不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.37,0:43:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们最终还是再会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, finally, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.83,0:43:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么才来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.63,0:44:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,布 谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cuckoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.10,0:44:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了 米老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ciao, Mickey Mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.26,0:45:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是跟我闹着玩儿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.45,0:45:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.68,0:46:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫莫尼彭尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moneypenny...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.23,0:47:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,邦德？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.31,0:47:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 莫尼彭尼 汉堡 突尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Moneypenny. Hamburg, Tunisia,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.15,0:47:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,和墨西哥袭击是相互关联的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mexico City, they're all linked.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.90,0:47:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是同一个组织策划的连环袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one organization coordinating multiple attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.69,0:47:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看来她说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, she was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.07,0:47:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,她就没错过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.32,0:47:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我查过了 - 谁打来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I ran that check. - Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.58,0:47:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是我老板 他信用卡被偷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my boss had his credit card stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.91,0:47:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不是大事 你赶紧先睡去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing. Why don't you go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.25,0:47:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别弄太久啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.33,0:47:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁在那儿？- 没谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who was that? - No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.17,0:47:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你没说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.46,0:47:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就一普通朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.75,0:47:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,大半夜还在你那儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this time of night?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.96,0:47:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,生活就是这样 詹姆斯 有时你也该体验下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called life, James. You should try it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.89,0:47:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 幽冥国王 貌似是位你曾经交过手的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Pale King. It looks like you've had dealings with him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.10,0:47:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 量子危机那次 - 果不其然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Quantum. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.52,0:47:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是怀特先生 就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. White! That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.15,0:47:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,最近一次现身 是在奥地利的奥尔陶斯 四个月前的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last unconfirmed sighting, Altaussee in Austria, four months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.57,0:47:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你先等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold that thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.46,0:48:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还没挂吧？- 没挂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You still there? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.50,0:48:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我再报个名字 行吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run another name, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.96,0:48:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.13,0:48:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是个男的 叫弗朗兹·奥伯豪斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man called Franz Oberhauser. He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.80,0:48:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,查查他生前和死后的档案和行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And check his files before and after his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.47,0:48:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么还有死后 什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After his death? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.31,0:48:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 你照办就是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.19,0:49:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 Q 给我亮亮家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Q, give me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.57,0:50:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真是越来越给劲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.33,0:50:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,试试手气吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.08,0:50:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.81,0:51:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不要听信他们减少监控的主张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not let them tell you we need less surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.48,0:51:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,相反要增加更多 更加多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need more. Much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.06,0:51:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿重申 这个九只眼委员会将有权获得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say again, the Nine Eyes committee would have full access
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.03,0:51:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所有成员国的情报信息流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the combined intelligence streams of all member states.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.32,0:51:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,数据越多分析得越透彻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More data, more analysis,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.91,0:51:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,发生恐怖袭击的可能性就会越低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}less likelihood of a terrorist attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.95,0:51:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.16,0:51:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,到了全世界安全机构联合起来的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's time for the security services of the world to unite.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.71,0:51:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,各自为战 我们不堪一击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alone, we are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.38,0:51:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,联合起来 我们汇聚全球力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, we're a global power.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.67,0:51:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这肯定不走选举程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An unelected one.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.63,0:51:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.18,0:51:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.14,0:51:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就方案进行表决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will now vote on the resolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.60,0:51:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 请开始投票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, please cast your vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.86,0:51:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,结果是八票赞成一票反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vote is eight to one in favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.28,0:51:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但是如各位所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, as you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.07,0:52:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,只有全票赞成才能通过决议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we cannot proceed unless by unanimous vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.53,0:52:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因此 九只眼议案未能获得通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Nine Eyes motion is therefore not passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.20,0:52:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是民主啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Democracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.45,0:52:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢女士们先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.54,0:52:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚的会议现在休会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This evening's session is adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.30,0:52:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,长官您好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.39,0:52:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托请告诉我007就在伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, tell me 007 is in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.81,0:52:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.10,0:52:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我那个 现在先让我看一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, I'll just take a look now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.85,0:52:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他要是不在 你丫麻烦就大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if he isn't, you're in deep shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.52,0:52:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我TM就给你10秒钟时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got precisely 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.49,0:52:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了 长官 他应该是在切尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have him, sir. He appears to be in Chelsea.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.24,0:52:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,给我盯死了 等我回来 明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, lwant eyes on him when I get back, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.04,0:52:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全明白您的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I completely understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.17,0:52:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.05,0:55:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我个忙行吗？下手要快点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do me a favor. Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.92,0:55:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,到楼上来 怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Upstairs, Mr. White.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.10,0:56:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道死神会以一张熟悉的面孔前来索命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always knew death would wear a familiar face,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.94,0:56:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但没想到会是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.53,0:56:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我为何会有此等荣幸啊 邦德先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To what do I owe this pleasure, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.82,0:56:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,最近我参加了一场会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was at a meeting recently
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.20,0:56:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然后出现了你的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your name came Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.20,0:56:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很荣幸伦敦方面还在讨论我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm flattered London is still talking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.25,0:56:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是军情六处的会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't MI6.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.79,0:56:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是在罗马开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.29,0:56:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是你的组织 不是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yourteam, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.30,0:56:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,上个月 我在手机里发现了剧毒的金属铊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last month, I found thallium in my cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.14,0:56:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他真是不辱使命 我就剩几个星期了 没准还短点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's done its job. I have a few weeks. Maybe less.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.69,0:56:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说真是缘分啊 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, here we are, Mr. Bond,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.11,0:56:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,两个将死之人一起共度良宵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two dead men enjoying the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.57,0:56:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底干了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.15,0:56:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有听他的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I disobeyed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.12,0:56:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾竭尽全力追随他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I followed him as far as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.33,0:56:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可是他变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.95,0:57:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.00,0:57:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你良心发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You grew a conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.13,0:57:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们恩怨归恩怨 可这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our game is our game. But this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.09,0:57:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,干扯上女人 扯上儿童\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Women, children...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.92,0:57:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这金属铊起码说明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the thallium would suggest
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.30,0:57:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他不再欣赏你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he doesn't like you very much anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.43,0:57:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你看他也是一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And clearly the feeling is mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.39,0:57:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不如告诉我该怎样找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why don't you tell me how to find him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.68,0:57:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.77,0:57:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.31,0:57:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他无处不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.35,0:57:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,无处不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.77,0:57:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他堂而皇之地坐在你书桌前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's sitting at your desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.73,0:57:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他吻着你的女人 还和你家人淡定地共进晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's kissing your lover, he's eating supper with your family!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.37,0:57:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在掩护某个人吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're protecting someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.54,0:57:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是你夫人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.04,0:57:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,她很久之前就不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She left long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.59,0:57:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的儿子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.01,0:57:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你女儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.10,0:57:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你找不到她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.72,0:58:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她相当聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.27,0:58:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她比我聪明 知道怎么躲起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's smarter than me. She knows how to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.98,0:58:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,说出那人在哪 我就能保护你女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can protect her if you tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.15,0:58:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我能保住她的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can keep her alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.90,0:58:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.99,0:58:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.32,0:58:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你向我承诺？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your word?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.53,0:58:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一个杀手也能信？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The word of an assassin!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.80,0:58:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说到做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.33,0:59:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}L'Américain.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.87,0:59:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要能救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You save her,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.75,0:59:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她就能带你去 美国人 那儿 她非常了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she can lead you to L'Américain. She knows L'Américain.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.63,0:59:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,先去霍夫勒诊所看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try the Hoffler Klinik.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.51,0:59:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在就是只风筝 在飓风中飞舞的风筝 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a kite dancing in a hurricane, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.14,0:59:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,永别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Solong.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.62,1:00:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真行 能让政府财政出钱为这个吐血买单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't deny I'm impressed you got H.M.G. to cough up for all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.91,1:00:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,得了 政府哪有钱盖这种大楼啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good God, the government couldn't afford this kind of facility.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.46,1:00:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分还得靠私营企业的捐助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it was benefactors mostly, from the private sector.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.71,1:00:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,当正式运行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it goes online,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.83,1:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这栋楼将成为史上最强悍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this building will be the most sophisticated
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.71,1:00:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,数据收集系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}data gathering system in history.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.76,1:00:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,成为全天候主宰世界的数字幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world's digital ghost, available 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.84,1:00:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也是乔治·奥威尔的终极噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George Orwell's worst nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.55,1:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.22,1:00:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,九只眼未获全票通过真是遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My commiserations on losing the Nine Eyes vote.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.14,1:00:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,对你打击挺大吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must have been a blow.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.31,1:00:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,倒没什么 南非方面想通也只是个时间问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really. Only a matter of time before the South Africans see the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.89,1:00:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,而且罗马也不是一天建成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know what they say, Rome wasn't built in a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.19,1:00:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,可能用了一天半呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Day and a half maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.23,1:00:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我说麦克斯 我知道监控这事是日常必备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Max, I know surveillance is a fact of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.78,1:01:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但让我担心的是你使用情报的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's how you use the information that concerns me,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.70,1:01:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,以及谁会用这些情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and who is using it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.24,1:01:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这是保障公众安全所必须的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what we need to do to keep the people safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.24,1:01:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,00项目已经过时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double-0 program is prehistoric.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.41,1:01:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你还能单靠一个特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, M. You can't really tell me that one man in the field
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.92,1:01:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就包打天下吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can compete with all of this,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.71,1:01:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有杀人执照也力不从心啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}running around out there with his license to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.51,1:01:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有真正杀过人 麦克斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever had to kill a man, Max?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.30,1:01:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.09,1:01:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要心里有底 你才可以扣动扳机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To pull that trigger, you have to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.60,1:01:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 先要进行调查 要分析评估 锁定目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you investigate, analyze, assess, target.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.43,1:01:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你要盯着对方的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you have to look him in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.98,1:01:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,接着做出判断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you make the call.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.11,1:01:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那些个无人机 窃听器 摄像头 速记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all the drones, bugs, cameras, transcripts,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.36,1:01:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,以及所有现行的监控手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the surveillance in the world
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.45,1:01:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,都不会告诉你下一步怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can't tell you what to do next.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.78,1:01:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一张杀人执照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A license to kill
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.95,1:01:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,也是一张不乱杀人的执照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is also a license not to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.04,1:01:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我这么做也是被迫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want to have to do this,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.59,1:02:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像已经控制不了你的特工了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it looks like you still can't control your agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.80,1:02:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,邦德 我帮你查过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond? I ran that check.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.51,1:02:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,貌似是位你曾经交过手的人 量子危机那次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you've had dealings with him before. Quantum.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.30,1:02:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,果不其然 是怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. Mr. White!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.39,1:02:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,最近一次现身 是在奥地利的奥尔陶斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last unconfirmed sighting, Altaussee in Austria.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.73,1:02:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我再报个名字行吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run another name, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.40,1:02:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,所以实施全面监控看来并非无稽之谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So maybe there's something to be said for total surveillance after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.82,1:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你们监控军情六处的探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You watch MI6 agents?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.41,1:02:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们谁都监控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We watch everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.39,1:03:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,您先请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.81,1:03:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我这边很快就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be with you in just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.91,1:03:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,请多包涵 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please excuse me, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.58,1:04:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是玛德琳·斯旺医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Dr. Madeleine Swann.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.17,1:04:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们今天的任务是分析你的需求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ourjob today is to analyze your needs,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.09,1:04:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,包括心理和身体两个层面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}both psychological and physical.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.76,1:04:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真是开门见山啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm, sounds pretty straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.59,1:04:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,希望您别介意 这景色容易让人分心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you don't mind. The view can be distracting.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.09,1:04:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没注意到呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hadn't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.23,1:04:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,您已经填了大部分的材料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you filled out most of the paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.27,1:04:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的话想问一下剩余的几个问题以完成评估\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a few questions to complete your evaluation, ifl may.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.65,1:04:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你平时锻炼吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you exercise?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.65,1:04:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,必要时才炼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.57,1:04:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得工作给你带来的压力大吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you consider your employment to be psychologically stressful?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.62,1:04:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.29,1:04:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一般会喝多少酒？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much alcohol do you consume?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.79,1:04:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,过量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.92,1:04:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我的问题再放宽点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some broader questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.46,1:04:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,小时候 你跟你的父母很亲近吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a child, would you say you were close to your parents?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.05,1:04:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我从小父母就去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My parents died when I was young.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.34,1:04:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当时几岁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? How old?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.51,1:04:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,反正能记事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old enough to remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.35,1:04:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,能问问怎么死的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How, ifl may ask?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.81,1:04:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,爬山时发生了意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a climbing accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.06,1:05:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,谁把你抚养成人的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So who brought you up?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.23,1:05:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是别的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.48,1:05:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我能问问吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humor me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.69,1:05:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一位就读过牛津和索邦两所名校 当上顾问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does one train at Oxford and the Sorbonne become a consultant,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.53,1:05:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在无国界医生组织工作两年的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spend two years with Médecins Sans Frontiéres
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.65,1:05:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会来到这荒山野岭的地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and end up here?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.41,1:05:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,请恕我冒昧 人家很容易会认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me, but anyone might think
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.83,1:05:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在有所回避\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were hiding from something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.45,1:05:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,您来这儿可是花了不少钱的 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're paying a lot of money to be here, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.83,1:05:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是我问你啊 还是你问我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's asking the questions, you or me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.33,1:05:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,当然你问了 请继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.92,1:05:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这最后一问你是空着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you left this final question blank.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.47,1:05:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你做什么职业？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your occupation?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.93,1:05:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这个要是填在表上恐怕会不太好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's not the sort of thing that looks good on a form.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.93,1:05:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.10,1:05:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我的工作是杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kill people.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.27,1:05:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这世界多小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small world?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.11,1:05:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他人在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.53,1:05:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.44,1:05:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,两天前的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.03,1:05:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.66,1:05:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我就在现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I was there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.78,1:05:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.95,1:05:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我没那必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.79,1:06:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他是自杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did it himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.21,1:06:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,大老远来就为了告诉我这个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you came all the way just to tell me this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.83,1:06:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我父亲已经死了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That my father's dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.63,1:06:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说的是你生命有危险 而且我需要你帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came to tell you that your life is in danger and I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.59,1:06:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 我和他有过约定 要保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - I made a deal with him to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.39,1:06:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你在撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.39,1:06:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他凭什么相信你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would he trust you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.81,1:06:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他也知道我有求于你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he knew that I needed something in return.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.23,1:06:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你想干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.23,1:06:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我找到 美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To find L'Américain.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.06,1:06:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,询问结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This interview is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.40,1:06:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,斯旺医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Swann...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.73,1:06:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,给你你10分钟离开这里 然后我会呼叫保安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have 10 minutes to leave the building. Then I'm calling security.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.57,1:06:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 斯旺医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Dr. Swann.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.72,1:07:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,想来点什么吗 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I get you something, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.23,1:07:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,伏特加马提尼 摇 但别搅拌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vodka martini. Shaken, not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.77,1:07:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉告诉您 我们不提供酒水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, we don't serve alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.90,1:07:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是越来越喜欢这儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really starting to love this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.11,1:07:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,给他来一杯含消化酶的奶昔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll have the prolytic digestive enzyme shake.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.78,1:07:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.15,1:07:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是来取车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you've come for the car,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.61,1:07:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,车已经沉到台伯河底去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I parked it at the bottom of the Tiber.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.28,1:07:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 007 那只是辆价值三百万英镑的概念车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not to worry, 007. lt was only a £3,000,000 prototype.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.58,1:07:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么来了 Q？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you here, Q?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.79,1:07:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是纯粹想休息一下而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I just fancied a break, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.79,1:07:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,最近工作压力有点大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been a tad stressed at work recently.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.96,1:07:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,军情五处整天盯着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What with C's people crawling all over us
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.96,1:07:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,M也想把我挂在圣诞树上当装饰品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the fact that M wants my balls for Christmas decorations.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.96,1:07:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说重点 - 007 重点就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get to the point. - The point, 007,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.21,1:07:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,弗朗兹·奥伯豪斯不仅死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that Franz Oberhauser is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.38,1:07:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,棺材都下葬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead and buried.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.97,1:07:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你现在就跟我回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And unless you come back with me right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.34,1:07:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我和莫尼彭尼都前途不保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my career and Moneypenny's will go the same way.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.35,1:07:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白吗 现在事态已经全面失控了 你要是不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand? All hell is breaking loose out there and...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.35,1:07:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见他了 那是你的臆想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw him. You thought you saw him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.06,1:07:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们查阅了所有记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been through the records.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.73,1:07:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,20年前他和他父亲死于一场雪崩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died in an avalanche with his father 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.44,1:07:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是 这些我都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.48,1:07:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的确又见到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.99,1:08:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不可能忘记他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not someone I'll ever forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.45,1:08:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说 你有什么头绪吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you have a lead?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.66,1:08:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,有这么个名字 美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a name. L'Américain.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.54,1:08:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这就能缩小范围了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that narrows it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.46,1:08:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 007 先说到这儿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm sorry, 007, but time's up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.83,1:08:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我的前途现在悬于一线了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My whole career is on the line here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.96,1:08:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要么你现在回去走正常的渠道办事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either you come back in and do this through proper channels,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.46,1:08:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要么我直接向M报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or I go directly to M.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.67,1:08:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,再帮我办件事吧 然后就没你事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do one more thing for me. Then you're out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.38,1:08:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,查查这东西的来头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find out what you can from this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.15,1:08:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在真是恨死你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really, really hate you right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.06,1:08:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 Q\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.73,1:08:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先生 行了吗？- 请稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Monsieur? Now? - Please?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.90,1:08:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你住哪啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you staying?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.03,1:08:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,佩夫斯纳旅馆 12号房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Pevsner. Room 12.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.20,1:08:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一小时后见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.82,1:08:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,您的饮料 先生 一杯热解消化酶奶昔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you are, sir. One prolytic digestive enzyme shake.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.58,1:08:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,能帮我个忙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do me a favor, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.00,1:08:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,把这玩意倒厕所里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw that down the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.21,1:08:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,中间环节都省了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut out the middleman.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.09,1:09:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你待着别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.23,1:09:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想要什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.11,1:10:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.99,1:10:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都是哑巴吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't any of you speak?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.11,1:13:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,顶住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.84,1:14:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 别碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Argh, don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.42,1:14:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.72,1:14:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该先好好喘口气 冷静一下情绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to take a breath and calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.80,1:14:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你是受惊吓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.93,1:14:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,离我远点 给我走开行不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from me! Just get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.85,1:14:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得是你把他们引来的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did it cross your mind that you led them to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.69,1:14:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在没时间解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't got time for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.77,1:14:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须告诉我和 美国人 有关的一切细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to tell me everything you know about L'Américain.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.11,1:14:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.57,1:15:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你父亲保证过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave your father my word!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.58,1:15:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我凭什么相信你 就因为我父亲信任你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why should I trust you? Because my father did?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.71,1:15:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因为此时此刻 斯旺医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because right now, Dr. Swann,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.63,1:15:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你活下去的唯一机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your best chance of staying alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.53,1:15:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,斯旺医生 这位是Q\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Swann, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.28,1:15:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Q 这位是斯旺医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Q, Dr. Swann.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.03,1:15:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 幸会幸会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. - Enchanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.70,1:15:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,邦德 我们俩先谈 不带她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond, we need to talk. Alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.75,1:15:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,她都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.96,1:15:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可是 邦德 - 她已经知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But, Bond... - She knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.75,1:15:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你查到了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.63,1:15:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我得向你道歉 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe you an apology, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.51,1:15:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你这回中大奖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are onto something.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.59,1:16:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,奥伯豪斯确实还没死 这戒指就是证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oberhauser is still alive. The ring proves it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.26,1:16:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我搜遍了近五年的工作记录 他们都指向同一个组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it seems they were all part of one organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.64,1:16:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,拉契夫 量子项目 斯奇亚拉 你的朋友 席尔瓦先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Le Chiffre, Quantum, Sciarra, your friend Mr. Silva.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.64,1:16:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他们都和谁有关联吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do you know who links them all?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.44,1:16:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.90,1:16:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没错就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.32,1:16:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这个神秘组织 知道它叫什么名字吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This organization, do you know what it's called?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.19,1:16:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 幽灵党\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Spectre.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.03,1:16:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,它的名字叫 幽灵党\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its name is Spectre.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.66,1:16:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么会知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does she know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.74,1:16:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我父亲就是组织成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because my father was part of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.96,1:16:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你应该看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I think that you ought to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.12,1:16:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,现在切换到南非现场传来的画面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking at pictures from South Africa right now
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.79,1:16:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能看到的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of what appears to be a huge explosion.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.84,1:16:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Q 马上回伦敦去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Q, go back to London.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.72,1:16:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,M需要你的帮助 然后继续追踪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M's gonna need your help. And keep tracking me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.80,1:16:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.43,1:16:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 邦德 你一定要找到 美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Bond, you have to find L'Américain.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.68,1:16:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他是找到奥伯豪斯的唯一线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's our only link to Oberhauser.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.81,1:16:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a person.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.44,1:16:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不是一个人 那是一个地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a place.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.25,1:18:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.45,1:18:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他俩就在这儿过的新婚之夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where they spent their wedding night.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.29,1:18:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,然后每年都会回来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They came back every year.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.21,1:18:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,后来又带着我一起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then they brought me with them, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.59,1:18:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,即使后来都离婚了 父亲一个人还来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He kept coming back, even after the divorce.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.85,1:18:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那我觉得 太遗憾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.64,1:18:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What for?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.82,1:19:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SWANNI What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.04,1:19:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,属于你的遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.41,1:19:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不来点吗？- 不了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Want some? - No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.50,1:19:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,错过了好事别赖我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what you're missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.80,1:19:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能就这么点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.68,1:19:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 先敬你爸一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here's to your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.14,1:19:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应过我自己 绝不让自己再受到那个男人的伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised myself I would never be hurt by that man again.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.32,1:19:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他断了一切联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cut off all contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.03,1:19:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也不想跟他和他的生活有任何关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want anything to do with him or his sick life.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.70,1:19:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,而他就在断气之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, with his dying breath
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.70,1:19:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,却让你来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he sends me you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.66,1:19:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真讽刺啊 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ironic, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.25,1:20:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该对他这么狠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't be so hard on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.88,1:20:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他本来早几周前就要死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man ljust met should have been dead weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.17,1:20:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,硬撑着没咽气就是为了你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only reason his heart was still beating was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.17,1:20:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我会抽时间去看我的父亲 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll mourn my father in my own time, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.22,1:20:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我要去睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, now, I'm going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.90,1:20:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,休想有一丝邪念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think for one moment
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.18,1:20:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我会因为父亲死了 就会对你投怀送抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think for one moment this is where I fall into your arms,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.07,1:20:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,寻求精神慰藉吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seeking solace for my dead daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.08,1:20:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我坐那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sit there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.24,1:20:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好好站岗 那是你最擅长的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep watch. That's what you're good at.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.88,1:20:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你胆敢靠近我一步 我就杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come anywhere near me and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.05,1:20:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这我毫不怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.35,1:21:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快看 那儿有两个你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. There are two of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.65,1:21:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有两个詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two Jameses.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.61,1:21:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我可真幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.41,1:21:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.32,1:21:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,致骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To liars...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.29,1:21:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,和杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and killers.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.52,1:21:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,致骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To liars...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.89,1:21:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,和杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and killers...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.68,1:21:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们无所不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.63,1:22:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,谁派你来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who sent you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.88,1:22:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你在替谁卖命？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you working for?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.25,1:22:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底躲哪儿了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.03,1:23:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,果然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.95,1:24:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.17,1:24:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.97,1:25:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.89,1:25:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.81,1:25:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲当时在扫描某个卫星电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father was scanning for a particular satellite phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.44,1:25:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他在找某个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.24,1:25:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他找的是这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.78,1:25:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他是让我来完成他的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he sent me here to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.37,1:25:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要跟你一起去 - 不 你别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm coming with you. - No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.37,1:25:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like you alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.75,1:25:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我能照顾好自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can look after myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.33,1:25:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这个并不是重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's beside the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.55,1:25:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能有去无回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might not be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.59,1:25:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.76,1:25:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想知道我父亲究竟遭遇了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I want to understand what happened to my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.24,1:26:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧 他是去什么地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where was he going?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.91,1:26:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不毛之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No where.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.55,1:26:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.59,1:26:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,会议提前了 你没收到信息吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The meeting was brought forward. Did you not get the message?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.60,1:26:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,根本就没收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.76,1:26:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这是史上最短的会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shortest meeting I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.22,1:26:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,难道南非也同意了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}South Africans on board, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.77,1:26:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是啊 他们也只能如此了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, who can blame them?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.10,1:26:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,九只眼协议现在正式生效了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine Eyes is now officially sanctioned.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.31,1:26:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,新系统72小时内就启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new system goes live in less than 72 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.94,1:26:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是向前了一大步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a major step forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.98,1:26:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,全球性的情报合作将改变一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Global intelligence cooperation changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.90,1:26:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前说过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you said before.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.45,1:26:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.41,1:26:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们让我来领导这个委员会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've asked me to head the new committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.62,1:26:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 然后呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes? And?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.58,1:26:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我得跟你说 我已经跟内政大臣谈过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I should tell you I've spoken with the Home Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.37,1:27:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,鉴于我给他的新信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in light of the new information I've given him,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.13,1:27:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他决定立即停止00特工计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's decided to close down the double-0 program with immediate effect.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.63,1:27:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你在做什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.88,1:27:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不是针对你个人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.88,1:27:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那是未来所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.89,1:27:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.64,1:27:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经过时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.68,1:27:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你丫不要太狂啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a cocky little bastard, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.81,1:27:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我就当你在夸我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take that as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.65,1:27:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,想得美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.07,1:27:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这事儿还没完呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.00,1:27:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我熨下好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you press this for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.97,1:27:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 先生 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.19,1:28:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,拿起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.82,1:28:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.70,1:28:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应过你爸要保护你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised him I'd protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.07,1:28:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,所以第一件事就是教你保护自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first thing to do is to teach you how to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.20,1:28:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是误伤了你怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I shoot you by mistake?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.54,1:28:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,误伤又不是第一次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't be the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.04,1:28:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,拿起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.37,1:28:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了 我讨厌枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, I hate guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.97,1:28:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是西格226\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SIG 226.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.93,1:28:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,前准星 后瞄准器 击锤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Front sight. Rear sight. Hammer.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.35,1:28:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需要瞄准 扣动扳机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just point it. You squeeze the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.69,1:28:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,尽量不要闭眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You try not to close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.56,1:28:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,听我的 试试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.43,1:29:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你已经无师自通了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have to teach you anything, do I?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.10,1:29:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经有个男的来我家要杀我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man once came to our house to kill my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.85,1:29:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可他不知道我就在楼上卧室里玩儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't know I was upstairs playing in my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.10,1:29:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也不知道我爸在水池下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or that Papa kept a Beretta Nine-millimeter
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.48,1:29:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,藏了一把9毫米的伯莱塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under the sink with the bleach.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.94,1:29:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我特别痛恨枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I hate guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.24,1:29:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看来也能跳过徒手格斗教学了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we'll skip hand-to-hand combat.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.80,1:29:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.97,1:29:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉打断您的晚餐 我们刚收到新消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to interrupt yoursuppen but we have some news.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.14,1:29:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.68,1:30:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,通过使用 智能血液 我们已经追踪到了邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Using the Smart Blood, I've tracked Bond
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.23,1:30:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他人在北非\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to a point here in North Africa.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.02,1:30:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,现在所有地图都指向那片沙漠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, every known map registers it as empty desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.77,1:30:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 但您看这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. But if you look
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.57,1:30:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星放大图像却能看到这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the satellite blowup, you can clearly see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.95,1:30:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们帮不了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't help him.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.66,1:30:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们知道他要去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, sir, we know where he's heading.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.12,1:30:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,C正监视我们的一举一动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C is watching everything we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.08,1:30:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这么做只会给他白送情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're only handing them more information.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.92,1:30:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我们不能这样抛弃邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we can't just desert Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.38,1:30:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,无能为力 他只能被削弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to. We only make him weaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.51,1:30:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们知道他在哪儿啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, sir, we know exactly where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.17,1:30:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这我明白 我们能追踪他 别人也一样可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I know, but ifwe can track him, so can others.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.64,1:30:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,给我删除所有 智能血液 相关文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Delete all the Smart Blood files.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.01,1:30:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,要不留痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.06,1:30:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他只有靠自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on his own.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.04,1:31:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,盯着多不合适啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't stare.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.42,1:31:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 这是同一个人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you shouldn't look like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.55,1:31:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,帮你点杯开胃酒吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I get you an apéritif?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.39,1:31:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还没想好呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.76,1:31:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我喝酒可会惹麻烦 会让我做出格的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It gets me into trouble. Makes me do crazy things.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.93,1:31:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那样可不行啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.85,1:31:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就来伏特加马提尼 加点刺激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I'll have a vodka martini, dirty.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.69,1:31:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我也来那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make that two.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.74,1:31:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.53,1:31:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,什么问题？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.82,1:31:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么有那么多职业可供选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, given every other possible option,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.07,1:31:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,偏有人要当职业杀手呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}does a man choosethelfie of a paid assassin?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.62,1:31:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不当杀手 当牧师怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it was that or the priesthood.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.75,1:31:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是认真的 这就是你想要的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm serious. Is this really what you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.33,1:31:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,整天躲在阴影之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Living in the shadows?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.82,1:31:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,追杀别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hunting?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.08,1:31:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,或被别人追杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being hunted?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.59,1:31:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,背后总有人盯着你 一直是孤独一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always looking behind you? Always alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.93,1:32:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,可我并不孤独\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.97,1:32:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你先回答我的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.76,1:32:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道自己是否有得可选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure I ever had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.60,1:32:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但我也不会专门想这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, I don't stop to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.98,1:32:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你如果想了会怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would happen if you did?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.73,1:32:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 专门去想吗？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.15,1:32:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.24,1:32:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是您的酒 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your drinks, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.95,1:32:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,请先放那里吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you leave them there, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.67,1:32:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 我觉得你错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I think you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.17,1:32:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我错了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.80,1:32:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都会有选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We always have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.47,1:32:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就为这个干一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll drink to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.27,1:35:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.69,1:35:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.80,1:36:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这样估计要等很久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This might be a long wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.09,1:36:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你要不要重新考虑下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you having second thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.93,1:36:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,为时已晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.03,1:37:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.76,1:37:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那车 可是1948年产的劳斯莱斯银魅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a 1948 Rolls-Royce Silver Wraith.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.70,1:38:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,请上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.81,1:38:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我很害怕 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm scared, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.44,1:39:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,下午好 邦德先生 斯旺医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon, Mr. Bond, Dr. Swann.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.40,1:39:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,终于能见到你们 我们都深感荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to knowjust how excited we all are to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.28,1:39:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也很高兴能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's a pleasure to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.28,1:39:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,主人想请你们先休息放松一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your host invites you both to rest,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.83,1:39:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,四点的时候会请你们喝一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}relax, and join him for drinks at 4:00.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.62,1:39:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 转告你主人 我们会准时到 - 好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell our host we won't be late. - Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.21,1:39:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,带你们去房间前 还有一件事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before we show you to your rooms, just one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.64,1:39:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你可要小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You be careful with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.18,1:39:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,它已经上膛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifsloaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.23,1:39:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.75,1:40:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个非常特别的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a very special place.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.46,1:40:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,主人已要求我们 只能你们独自进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has requested you enter it alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.30,1:41:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.14,1:41:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来杯香槟吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Champagne?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.81,1:41:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,要不再等会儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.93,1:41:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.67,1:41:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们该表现出惊叹的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we're meant to be impressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.15,1:41:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,摸摸看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Touch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.07,1:42:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你想摸 但摸无妨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can touch it ifyou want.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.49,1:42:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这是什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.37,1:42:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这是块陨石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a meteorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.16,1:42:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.37,1:42:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,卡腾霍夫 人类已有的最古老陨石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Kartenhoff. The oldest in human possession.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.33,1:42:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是它在地球上留下了这个陨石坑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The very meteorite which made this crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.01,1:42:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,试想一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.88,1:42:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,先前那么多年里 它是那么孤独而寂静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So many years up there, alone, silent,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.68,1:42:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在积聚动能 最终在地球上留下印记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}building momentum until it chose to make its mark on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.39,1:42:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,它是股不可阻挡的巨大力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A huge, unstoppable force.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.69,1:42:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但他最终还是停下来了 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except it did stop, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.52,1:42:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,停在了这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.37,1:42:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你都不知道我期待这一刻有多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you how much I've been looking forward to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.29,1:43:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所有人重聚在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of us here, together.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.38,1:43:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一个小团圆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A reunion.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.09,1:43:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你也来了 亲爱的玛德琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so glad you came, too, dear Madeleine.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.72,1:43:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次见到你时 你还是个小女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were just a girl when I saw you first.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.94,1:43:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有次我去你家找你父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came to your home once to see your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.44,1:43:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.40,1:43:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可我记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Butldo.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.45,1:43:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,请吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.62,1:43:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.63,1:43:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,和情报有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Information.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.30,1:43:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,情报就是一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Information is all,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.34,1:43:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is it not?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.93,1:43:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,比如说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For example,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.43,1:43:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在应该知道00计划已经寿终正寝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must know by now that the double-0 program is officially dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.23,1:43:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我不禁好奇你为何而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which leads me to speculate exactly why you came.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.77,1:44:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 詹姆斯 你为何而来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, James, why did you come?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.15,1:44:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我来这是为了杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.82,1:44:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,而我认为你是来送死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I thought you came here to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.49,1:44:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,只是看问题的角度不同罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's all a matter of perspective.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.16,1:44:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,既然说到看问题的角度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of perspective.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.85,1:44:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是直播吗？- 实时画面 格林尼治时间十六点二十分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this live? - Live and direct. 16:20 GMT.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.48,1:44:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真是无巧不成书啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an uncanny coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.08,1:44:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,法语有一句谚语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The French have a saying,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.71,1:44:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"玻璃的宿命就是破碎"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"It's the fate of glass to break."
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.36,1:44:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,看来也许间谍的宿命 就是消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe it's the fate of spies to just disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.66,1:44:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不过幸运的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But with any luck,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.70,1:44:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有所成就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we leave something behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.99,1:44:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,与此同时 C会继续出色领导大家的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the meantime, l'm sure C will keep you all busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.25,1:45:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.67,1:45:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,真是感人 你不觉得吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's touching, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.68,1:45:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜啊 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, James,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.05,1:45:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你成了被遗忘的角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it looks like you're all alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.39,1:45:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道只是个偷窥狂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not much more than a voyeur, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.06,1:45:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,胆小到不敢加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too scared to join in.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.39,1:45:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你还没明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you quite understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.06,1:45:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我很明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.56,1:45:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你策划那几个城市的袭击 伤及无辜 就是逼人就范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You set cities on fire and watch innocent people burn,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.40,1:45:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,让那些政府加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you can convince governments to join...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.69,1:45:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你操盘的情报网络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an intelligence network you've paid for.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.41,1:45:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,整件事并不复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.95,1:45:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜我们的小朋友C 他该是你的门徒之一吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm guessing our little friend, C, he's one of your disciples.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.20,1:45:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.12,1:45:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他会得到什么好处？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what does he get out of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.71,1:45:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.54,1:45:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他和我都能看得很远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a visionary, like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.42,1:45:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看得远的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visionaries.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.88,1:45:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,精神病院里多的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psychiatric wards are full of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.88,1:45:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,而你连眼前都看不清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whereas you couldn't see what's right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.89,1:45:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们交手那么多次 你却从来没发现过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came across me so many times and yet you never saw me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.43,1:46:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,拉契夫 格林 席尔瓦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Le Chiffre, Greene, Silva.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.94,1:46:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.15,1:46:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.56,1:46:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你我之间有种模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A nice pattern developed.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.11,1:46:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你侵犯我的世界 我就毁掉你的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You interfered in my world, I destroyed yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.45,1:46:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得你生命中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or did you think it was coincidence
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.11,1:46:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所有女人最后都死了是种巧合吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that all the women in your life ended up dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.12,1:46:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就拿维斯帕·林德来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vesper Lynd, for example.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.66,1:46:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这位算是举足轻重的吧 他没跟你说起过吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was the big one. Has he told you about her?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.42,1:46:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,当然还有这位 你最亲爱的M夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, of course, your beloved M.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.46,1:46:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也永远离开了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.60,1:46:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.64,1:46:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是我干的 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Itwas all me, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.81,1:46:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都源于我 你所有痛苦都是我写就的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's always been me. The author of all your pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.44,1:46:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个勇敢的女人 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a brave woman, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.16,1:47:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于明白我父亲为什么会疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I understand why my father lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.66,1:47:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有疯 他就是软弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't lose his mind, he wasjustweak.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.62,1:47:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但他起码知道他是在与谁为敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But at least he understood what he was up against.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.00,1:47:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不能理解的一个残酷事实是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, they failed to comprehend the crucial fact,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.30,1:47:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一个可怕的事件也会催生完美的事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a terrible event canleadto something wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.34,1:47:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,既然说到你父亲 不妨让你也看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you mention your father, I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.35,1:47:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,她相当聪明 她比我聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's clever. She's smarter than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.98,1:47:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,知道怎么躲起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She knows how to hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.52,1:47:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我就能保护你女儿 说出那人在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can protect her if you tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.82,1:47:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我能保住她的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can keep her alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.57,1:47:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.86,1:47:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.16,1:47:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 快关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Turn this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.20,1:47:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你向我承诺？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your word?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.37,1:47:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一个杀手也能信？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The word of an assassin!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.87,1:47:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,马上给我关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.37,1:47:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这一段很重要 - 我说了马上关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is important. - I said turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.00,1:47:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你明白一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to understand something.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.39,1:48:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,说到做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.35,1:48:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,玛德琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madeleine?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.98,1:48:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.56,1:48:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别看他 玛德琳 看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at him, Madeleine. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.86,1:48:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}L'Américain.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.57,1:48:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要能救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You save her,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.49,1:48:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她就能带你去 美国人 那儿 她非常了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she can lead you to L'Américain. She knows L'Américain.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.37,1:48:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,先去霍夫勒诊所看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try the Hoff/er Klinik.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.92,1:48:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在就是只风筝 在飓风中飞舞的风筝 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a kite dancing in a hurricane, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.43,1:48:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,永别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.94,1:48:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那些能把人聚到一起的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The things that bring people together.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.23,1:48:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是恐惧 也许是美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of horror, beauty.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.43,1:49:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,肉体折磨太简单了 流于肤浅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Torture is easy, on a superficial level.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.31,1:49:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人可以看着自己被开膛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man can watch himself being disemboweled
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.94,1:49:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,从中会产生出巨大恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and derive great horror from the experience,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.19,1:49:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但这种折磨远未触及其灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's still going on at a distance.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.98,1:49:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,仍没有触及到他的真正内心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't taking place where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.63,1:49:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该很清楚 亲爱的玛德琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know all too well, dear Madeleine,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.35,1:49:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的他存在于他的大脑之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a man lives inside his head.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.62,1:49:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那里才安放着他的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where the seat of his soul is.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.75,1:49:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,最近我和詹姆斯同时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, James and lwere both present recently
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.29,1:49:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,目睹一个人刚被挖去双眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when a man was deprived of his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.80,1:50:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,接着一件最令人震惊的事情发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the most astonishing thing happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.17,1:50:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你注意到了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you notice?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.84,1:50:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他的灵魂已经不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.34,1:50:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他虽然还活着 可灵魂已死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd gone even though he was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.81,1:50:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就在生与死的那一瞬间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So in this brief moment between life and death,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.77,1:50:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他脑海里再没有任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was nobody inside his skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.15,1:50:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真是奇妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most odd.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.40,1:50:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.70,1:50:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to penetrate
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.32,1:50:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,渗透进你的大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.49,1:50:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,去触及你的灵魂所在 探索你的脑部世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the inside ofyourhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.79,1:50:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这第一根探针会玩弄你的视觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the first probe will play with your sight,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.92,1:50:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的听觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your hearing
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.67,1:50:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还有平衡感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your balance,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.88,1:50:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要最轻微的操作即可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just with the subtlest of manipulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.88,1:50:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就尽管来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, get on with it then.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.55,1:50:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么能比听你啰嗦更痛苦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing can be as painful as listening to you talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.68,1:50:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.81,1:50:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.88,1:51:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.07,1:51:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该知道 詹姆斯很小的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You probably know that James here
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.28,1:51:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就失去了双亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lost his parents when he was young.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.74,1:51:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但你知道吗 后来是我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But did you know that it was my father
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.28,1:51:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,陪他度过最艰难的时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who helped him through this difficult time?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.84,1:52:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,一连两个冬天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over the course of two winters
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.92,1:52:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲教他滑雪 教他登山 还有打猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he taught him to ski, and climb, and hunt.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.93,1:52:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他为这位蓝眼珠的可怜孤儿抚平了心灵创伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He soothed the wounds of the poor little blue-eyed orphan.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.98,1:52:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还让我把他当做自己的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asked me to treat him as a brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.15,1:52:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把他当做小弟弟看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My little brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.48,1:52:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之间结下了深厚情谊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They formed quite an attachment.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.15,1:52:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.11,1:52:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你选择把他杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.82,1:52:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 那是我干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, i did.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.83,1:52:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们应该能猜到 布谷鸟为了在别的鸟巢产卵会怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what happens when a cuckoo hatches inside another bird's nest?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.79,1:52:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.00,1:52:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,它会把别的蛋推出巢外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It forces the other eggs out.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.51,1:52:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.84,1:52:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 这只布谷鸟让我意识到我的父亲必须死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this cuckoo made me realize my father's life had to end.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.18,1:52:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可以说 我的所作所为是他逼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a way, he's responsible for the path I took.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.02,1:53:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所以谢谢你 布谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, thank you. Cuckoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.53,1:53:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,能来点别的鸟叫吗？弗朗兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know any other birdcalls, Franz?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.99,1:53:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 猫咪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, pussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.04,1:53:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,弗朗兹·奥伯豪斯20年前就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franz Oberhauser died 20 years ago, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.71,1:53:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟他父亲 同时死于一场雪崩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In an avalanche, alongside his father.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.71,1:53:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,现在跟你说话的人 你脑子里想的这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man you are talking to now, the man inside your head,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.89,1:53:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,叫恩内斯特·史戴弗·布鲁夫尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is Ernst Stavro Blofeld.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.89,1:53:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,大有来头？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catchy name.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.89,1:53:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,承袭自我母亲家族那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother's bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.35,1:53:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,探针要是在脑内梭状回里扎对了地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the needle finds the correct spot in the fusiform gyrus,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.07,1:53:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你就谁也不认识了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll recognize no one.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.32,1:53:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 你那些女人的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, the faces of your women
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.03,1:53:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,互相换来换去也无妨 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are interchangeable, aren't they, James?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.07,1:53:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你会连她都不认识的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't know who she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.74,1:54:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她只是你前往坟墓途中 看到的一张脸而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just another passing face on your way to the grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.71,1:54:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他临死的时候会根本认不出你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He dies not knowing who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.72,1:54:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,一个杀手的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The daughter of an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.22,1:54:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一能真正理解他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only one who could have understood him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.39,1:54:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shame.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.68,1:54:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.44,1:55:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那对蓝眼珠还认得出你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do those blue eyes still recognize you?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.32,1:55:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,到哪儿我都能认出你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd recognize you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.36,1:55:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.17,1:55:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,1分钟之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.01,1:55:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩1分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.51,1:55:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他说什么了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he say something?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.35,1:55:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,光阴似箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tempus fugit.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.52,1:55:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 光阴 似箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Tempus fugit.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.69,1:55:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,听不见 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hear you, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.07,1:55:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.20,1:55:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真是时光飞逝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't time fly?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.35,1:56:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,去那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In there!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.27,1:57:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.95,1:57:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这事儿还没完呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.46,1:58:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我没听说过希尔德布兰德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never even heard of Hildebrand.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.13,1:58:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才叫安全堡垒啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the general idea with safe houses.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.32,1:58:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这里能有多安全？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly how safe is this, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.03,1:58:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就能知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.32,1:58:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,果然安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.87,1:58:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在这等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.00,1:58:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是M\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm M.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.21,1:58:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,玛德琳·斯旺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madeleine Swann.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.33,1:58:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.38,1:58:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,007 你有什么新消息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you have for me, 007?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.29,1:59:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,最近死亡的幽灵党头目 恩内斯特·史戴弗·布鲁夫尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The recently deceased head of Spectre, Ernst Stavro Blofeld,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.01,1:59:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,以及他的情报部长 你的新搭档C\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his chief of intelligence, your new best friend, C.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.22,1:59:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就要接管他在我们眼皮子底下建的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About to take control of his very own global surveillance system
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.31,1:59:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那个强大的全球监控体系了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he built right here under our noses.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.89,1:59:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那最好抓紧时间 系统午夜就要启动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we'd better move. The system goes online at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.73,1:59:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要是得逞 幽灵党就会掌控一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that happens, Spectre will have control of everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.69,1:59:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我去会一会C\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you and I will have a quiet word with C
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.73,1:59:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,同时Q侵入系统 组织系统上线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while Q hacks into the system and stops it going online.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.03,1:59:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.11,1:59:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他会有办法的 他一向如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll find a way. He always does.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.33,1:59:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎你归队 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to have you back, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.08,1:59:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.76,1:59:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 我办不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.34,1:59:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我会回来找你的 等这一切结束之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll come back for you when it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.27,1:59:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.27,1:59:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不能待在这儿 还是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you can't stay here, or you...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.11,1:59:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能再过这种生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go back to this life.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.10,2:00:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不想让你做出改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not going to ask you to change.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.86,2:00:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是这种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is who you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.11,2:00:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你是要跟我告别？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.45,2:00:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.74,2:00:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.50,2:00:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好人 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a good man, James.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.69,2:01:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,黑进去了吗 Q？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you in yet, Q?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.69,2:01:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还有好几层难搞的防火墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few layers of impenetrable security still to go,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.06,2:01:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但我应该是有些进展了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I think I 'm getting somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.49,2:02:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们看见我们了 - 倒车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They've seen us! - Reverse!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.95,2:02:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.17,2:03:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,把他带进楼去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him in the building!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.25,2:03:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快走啊 走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move. Move!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.38,2:04:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快回去找到M 马上 两个都要抓到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back and find M, now! We need them both.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.39,2:04:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,被人监视的感觉不好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a good feeling being watched, is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.90,2:04:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉我这是你捣的鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me you're responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.90,2:04:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有 是我的军需官Q\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but my Quartermaster is.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.86,2:04:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他可不是一般的才华横溢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's extremely talented.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.70,2:04:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,做得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, bravo.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.82,2:05:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可你们没有意识到 你们已经被炒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in case you hadn't realized it, you two are out of a job.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.33,2:05:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你现在算是非法闯入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.62,2:05:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕是你错判局势了 麦克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid you've got the wrong end of the stick, Max.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.16,2:05:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要阻止系统上线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to stop this system going online.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.00,2:05:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还要把你也送进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I'm going to bring you in.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.50,2:05:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,未免无凭无据吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On what grounds exactly?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.34,2:05:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就凭你交友不慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor taste in friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.58,2:05:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,放眼看看这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.59,2:05:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一片混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chaos.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.88,2:06:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有像你这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because people like you,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.88,2:06:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,层层官僚和政客们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}paper-pushers and politicians,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.43,2:06:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,才会毫无担当 终日无所作为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are too spineless to do what needs to be done.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.43,2:06:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我跟其他人结成联盟 要让权力能物尽其用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I made an alliance to put the power where it should be.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.98,2:06:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你们打着民主政治的旗号 想让它胎死腹中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you want to throw it away for the sake of "democracy."
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.61,2:06:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这是何等荒唐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever the hell that is.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.82,2:06:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,令人费解 愚钝之极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How predictably moronic.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.49,2:06:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不就是M毕生的使命吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then isn't that what M stands for?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.66,2:06:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,愚蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Moron."
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.70,2:06:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们现在也清楚C先生的使命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we know what C stands for.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.67,2:06:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太大意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Careless."
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.29,2:07:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.04,2:07:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,no!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.07,2:08:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真是一只不死鸟啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a hard man to kill, Blofeld.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.54,2:08:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿没让你疼得太厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do hope that doesn't hurt too much.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.58,2:08:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我的伤口会愈合的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wounds will heal.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.13,2:08:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可你的伤口呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about yours?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.30,2:08:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,看看四周吧 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look around you, James. Look.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.09,2:08:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你的世界就剩下这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what's left of your world.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.55,2:08:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你所代表的一切 你所信仰的一切 都化作乌有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything you ever stood for, everything you believed in, a ruin.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.93,2:08:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们干嘛在这儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are we here?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.69,2:09:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你想我了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.31,2:09:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,并没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.24,2:09:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道有人想你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I know someone who does.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.50,2:09:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她人在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.38,2:09:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那得靠你去找了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's for you to find out.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.35,2:09:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,三分钟后 这座大楼会被夷为平地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In three minutes, this building will be demolished.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.43,2:09:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我轻易就能离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can get out easily.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.77,2:09:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而你得做出抉择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.90,2:09:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是豁出命去救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die trying to save her or
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.52,2:09:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还是 自己保命活在痛苦之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}save yourself and live with the pain.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.07,2:09:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你在虚张声势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.78,2:09:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我有吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:01.54,2:10:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你左右为难了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've really put you through it, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.17,2:10:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让我是你兄弟呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's brothers for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.71,2:10:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,太了解如何操纵你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They always know which buttons to press.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.56,2:10:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,玛德琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madeleine!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.86,2:10:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.99,2:10:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.53,2:10:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.62,2:10:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.70,2:10:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你先请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.13,2:10:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不正视现实 M？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't you just face it, M?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.47,2:10:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有存在价值了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.76,2:11:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我也许是没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.93,2:11:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但有些必须有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But something has to.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.07,2:11:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.28,2:11:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有邦德的消息吗？- 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any word on Bond? - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:59.82,2:12:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但我可以猜得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can hazard a guess.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.42,2:12:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,玛德琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madeleine!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.71,2:12:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,玛德琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madeleine!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.55,2:13:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你相信我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.05,2:13:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有选择吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.22,2:13:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.07,2:13:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.42,2:13:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别了 詹姆·斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-bye, James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.44,2:16:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 这里是管制区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, this is a terrorist alert.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.78,2:16:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,马洛里 00计划部的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mallory, double-0 section.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.24,2:16:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,解除戒备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand them down.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.62,2:16:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,E组 都别开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Echo team, hold fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:56.45,2:16:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,解除戒备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:34.20,2:17:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,了结了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish it.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:46.88,2:17:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快了结了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish it.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:01.14,2:18:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没有子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of bullets.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:19.50,2:18:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而且现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And besides,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:21.87,2:18:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有更重要的事情要办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got something better to do.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:10.34,2:19:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,根据2001年的《特殊措施法案》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under the Special Measures Act of 2001,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.59,2:19:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我代表英国政府正式拘捕你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lam detaining you on behalf of Her Majesty's Government.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:21.62,2:20:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.00,2:20:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你来这儿做什么？- 早安 Q\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing here? - Good morning, Q.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.88,2:20:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你走了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you'd gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:39.18,2:20:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:42.18,2:20:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还缺一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's just one thing I need.
